* PyPortfolioOpt 1.6.0
** Inputs
*** Expected returns\nmean historical, EMA, CAPM
*** Risk models\nsample, semicovariance, exp cov
*** Shrinkage\nLedoit-Wolf, OAS
*** Black-Litterman\nprior + views, Idzorek
** Architecture
*** BaseOptimizer\nweights, clean, save
*** BaseConvexOptimizer\ncvxpy variable, constraints
*** EfficientFrontier\nSemivariance, CVaR, CDaR
*** HRPOpt, CLA\nno cvxpy
*** DiscreteAllocation\ngreedy, integer LP
** Objectives
*** min volatility
*** max Sharpe\nvariable transform
*** efficient risk / return
*** quadratic utility
*** bounds, sectors, L2, costs
left side
** Pitfalls
*** rf default 0.0
*** NaN zero-filled\nin Ledoit-Wolf
*** one problem per object
*** LP reads prices by position
*** HRP breaks on SciPy 1.18
** Evidence
*** in-sample only
*** window changes weights
*** survivor universe
** Security review
*** no network, exec, pickle
*** no install hooks
*** Makefile curl | sh
@endmindmap
